repository-code: "https://github.com/tamwng/tam-control-toolbox"
abstract: "MATLAB implementation of structure-informed indirect adaptive predictive control. Fixed nonlinear regressors support recursive coefficient identification, nonlinear predictor reconstruction, and constrained control using a frozen affine horizon model. The numerical studies are exploratory evidence; independent confirmation is not claimed."
